# TDVP Wget command package

This package builds GNU Wget 1.25.0 from the locked Buildroot source closure.
The immutable TDVP firmware already owns `/usr/bin/wget`, so the package keeps
its RISC-V implementation at `/usr/libexec/tdvp-wget/wget` and exposes the
safe public command `tdvp-wget`.

After installation, use:

```sh
tdvp-wget --version
tdvp-wget --https-only -O /tmp/example.html https://example.com/
```

The package depends on the separately owned CA certificate, OpenSSL, and zlib
providers. Its locked source closure also contains host-side lzip and pkgconf,
which Buildroot needs to unpack and configure the Wget source offline.
